procedure:- 
1. clone the getting_started_todo_app from GitHub to local system 
2. navigate to the cloned project directory.
3. start the development environment using docker compose watch
4. docker reads the project config and builds the application images 
5. the required containers are created and started by docker compose.
6. open docker desktop & verify the running containers 
7. open & view image in docker desktop 
8. assign name to docker image as Avisha
9. verify the newly created image in docker desktop under the images
10. run the application in browser using the exposed local port. 